              "sourceId": "craig_product_knowledge",
              "sourceTitle": "Craig Hempcrete product and project facts",
              "chunkId": "craig_product_knowledge#2",
              "text": "The requirements document's 300 sq ft interior-retrofit workflow says 2.5–3 m³ at 2.5–3 inches, while the shipped estimator formula yields about 1.8–2.1 m³. This is an unresolved source conflict. When exact dimensions are supplied, report the deterministic estimator result and disclose the conflict if the reference workflow is relevant.\n\nFinal SKUs, packaging, and real prices are not set. The demo has no live inventory, checkout, payment, CRM, order management, or workshop-registration backend. Quantities stay in physical units rather than bags, pallets, or packages.",
